}


### =================================================================
# 3️⃣ AUTH — Get Current User
# =================================================================

### Me — With Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MiwiaWF0IjoxNzc0ODQzMjY0LCJleHAiOjE3NzUzNjE2NjR9.Y7GDSBLj1QwmebX26HUuGpQZvMQl9AH9DQ30E9sli9w

### Me — Without Token (should 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### Me — Invalid Token (should 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer invalidtoken123


