### Search User — Success
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/search?username=rezky

### Search User — Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/search?username=zzzzzzzzz

### Search User — Min 2 Karakter (should 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/search?username=a

### Search User — Empty Query (should 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/search?username=


