### =================================================================
# 7️⃣ FEED
# =================================================================

### Create Feed (upload image not possible via REST Client, test caption validation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/feed
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MiwiaWF0IjoxNzc0ODQzMjY0LCJleHAiOjE3NzUzNjE2NjR9.Y7GDSBLj1QwmebX26HUuGpQZvMQl9AH9DQ30E9sli9w
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="caption"

Test caption dari REST Client
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test.jpg
--boundary--

### Create Feed — Without Caption (should 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/feed
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MiwiaWF0IjoxNzc0ODQzMjY0LCJleHAiOjE3NzUzNjE2NjR9.Y7GDSBLj1QwmebX26HUuGpQZvMQl9AH9DQ30E9sli9w
